        <detaileddescription>
<para>Renders MOV results, with negation and swizzles, from constants, temporaries and the v1 attribute. The layout is described in <ref refid="d4/dac/classVertexShaderExceptionalMACTests" kindref="compound">VertexShaderExceptionalMACTests</ref>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_c_1 MOV c (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw NaN NaNs.y: hw qNaN NaNs.z: hw -qNaN NaNs.w: hw sNaN zeros and infs.x: hw 0 zeros and infs.y: hw -0 zeros and infs.z: hw inf zeros and infs.w: hw -inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_c_2 MOV c (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw MAX range edges.y: hw 2^-126 range edges.z: hw den range edges.w: hw -den mixed.x: hw 1.5 mixed.y: hw -1.5 mixed.z: hw NaN1 mixed.w: hw -NaN</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_c_1 MOV -c (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw -NaN NaNs.y: hw -qNaN NaNs.z: hw qNaN NaNs.w: hw -NaN? zeros and infs.x: hw -0 zeros and infs.y: hw 0 zeros and infs.z: hw -inf zeros and infs.w: hw inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_c_2 MOV -c (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw -MAX range edges.y: hw -2^-126 range edges.z: hw -den range edges.w: hw den mixed.x: hw -1.5 mixed.y: hw 1.5 mixed.z: hw -NaN? mixed.w: hw NaN</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_c_wzyx_1 MOV c.wzyx (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw sNaN NaNs.y: hw -qNaN NaNs.z: hw qNaN NaNs.w: hw NaN zeros and infs.x: hw -inf zeros and infs.y: hw inf zeros and infs.z: hw -0 zeros and infs.w: hw 0</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_c_wzyx_2 MOV c.wzyx (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw -den range edges.y: hw den range edges.z: hw 2^-126 range edges.w: hw MAX mixed.x: hw -NaN mixed.y: hw NaN1 mixed.z: hw -1.5 mixed.w: hw 1.5</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_c_yxwz_1 MOV -c.yxwz (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw -qNaN NaNs.y: hw -NaN NaNs.z: hw -NaN? NaNs.w: hw qNaN zeros and infs.x: hw 0 zeros and infs.y: hw -0 zeros and infs.z: hw inf zeros and infs.w: hw -inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_c_yxwz_2 MOV -c.yxwz (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw -2^-126 range edges.y: hw -MAX range edges.z: hw den range edges.w: hw -den mixed.x: hw 1.5 mixed.y: hw -1.5 mixed.z: hw NaN mixed.w: hw -NaN?</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_r0_1 MOV r0 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw NaN NaNs.y: hw qNaN NaNs.z: hw -qNaN NaNs.w: hw sNaN zeros and infs.x: hw 0 zeros and infs.y: hw -0 zeros and infs.z: hw inf zeros and infs.w: hw -inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_r0_2 MOV r0 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw MAX range edges.y: hw 2^-126 range edges.z: hw den range edges.w: hw -den mixed.x: hw 1.5 mixed.y: hw -1.5 mixed.z: hw NaN1 mixed.w: hw -NaN</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_r0_1 MOV -r0 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw -NaN NaNs.y: hw -qNaN NaNs.z: hw qNaN NaNs.w: hw -NaN? zeros and infs.x: hw -0 zeros and infs.y: hw 0 zeros and infs.z: hw -inf zeros and infs.w: hw inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_r0_2 MOV -r0 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw -MAX range edges.y: hw -2^-126 range edges.z: hw -den range edges.w: hw den mixed.x: hw -1.5 mixed.y: hw 1.5 mixed.z: hw -NaN? mixed.w: hw NaN</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_v1_1 MOV v1 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw NaN NaNs.y: hw qNaN NaNs.z: hw -qNaN NaNs.w: hw sNaN zeros and infs.x: hw 0 zeros and infs.y: hw -0 zeros and infs.z: hw inf zeros and infs.w: hw -inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_v1_2 MOV v1 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw MAX range edges.y: hw 2^-126 range edges.z: hw den range edges.w: hw -den mixed.x: hw 1.5 mixed.y: hw -1.5 mixed.z: hw NaN1 mixed.w: hw -NaN</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_v1_1 MOV -v1 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): NaNs.x: hw -NaN NaNs.y: hw -qNaN NaNs.z: hw qNaN NaNs.w: hw -NaN? zeros and infs.x: hw -0 zeros and infs.y: hw 0 zeros and infs.z: hw -inf zeros and infs.w: hw inf</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>MOV_neg_v1_2 MOV -v1 (16 values). On hardware the hw and rf cells are green and the SGE row green, red, red. Rows (label: hardware result): range edges.x: hw -MAX range edges.y: hw -2^-126 range edges.z: hw -den range edges.w: hw den mixed.x: hw -1.5 mixed.y: hw 1.5 mixed.z: hw -NaN? mixed.w: hw NaN </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
